    "text": "Let the heat capacity of insulated beaker be C.<br >Mass of aqueous content in Expt. 1<br > <math><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>100</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>×</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>200</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math> <br > <math><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>200</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>4.2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow></mrow></math> <br >Moles of acid, base neutralized in Expt. 1 <math><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>0.1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0.1</mn></math> <br > <math><mo>⇒</mo></math>  Heat absorbed in Expt. 1  <math><mo>=</mo><mn>0.1</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>57</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>5.7</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></math> <br > <math><mo>⇒</mo><mn>5.7</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1000</mn><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>200</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>4.2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>×</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></math> <br > <math><mo>⇒</mo><mn>5.7</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1000</mn><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>200</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4.2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>×</mo><mn>5.7</mn></math> <br > <math><mo>⇒</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>200</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>4.2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1000</mn></math> <br >In Second experiment<br > <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.1</mn></math> <br >Total mass of aqueous content = 200 g<br > <math><mo>⇒</mo></math>  Total heat capacity <math><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>200</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>4.2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1000</mn></math> <br > <math><mo>⇒</mo></math>  Heat released <math><mo>=</mo><mn>1000</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>5.6</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>5600</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></math> <br >Overall, only 0.1 mol of  <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></math>  undergo neutralization.<br > <math><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>5600</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>0.1</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> <br > <math><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>56,000</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>56</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow></mrow></math> <br > <math><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub